ould give them the win. Discarding B1 similarly has only 1 left. Discarding B2 has 4 left, making it the safest statistically.  \n- Given the prevalent wind is East (F1) and seat wind North (F4), neither is in my melds, so no extra points from winds.  \n- Primary objective: avoid discarding a tile that completes an opponent's hand. B2 is safest by tile count.  \n\nFinal choice: Play B2.\n\nAnswer: Play B2"}
